          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Tertiary Education Quality and Standards Agency (Charges) Act 2021</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Subsection 7(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the subsection, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__subsec-4">
                  <num>4</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(4)	For the purposes of subsection (3), disregard any costs that are likely to be offset by fees determined by TEQSA under <ref href="#sec-158">section 158</ref> of the <i>Tertiary Education Quality and Standards Agency Act 2011</i>.</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                    <p><i>House of Representatives on 24 June 2021</i></p>
                    <p><i>Senate on 10 August 2021</i>]</p>
                    <p>(77/21)</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
